# DarkPool UI Design System

Every screen must look like a shipped, polished fintech product. Use `useDesignTokens()` hook for all styling — never hardcode colors, spacing, or typography values.

## Core Philosophy

- **Dark-first, always**: Green-black backgrounds, NOT gray-black. Every surface has a subtle green undertone.
- **Green = money = action**: `#00C805` is the brand color — used for CTAs, active states, gains, pill tabs.
- **Glass & depth**: Layered surfaces with blur + semi-transparent backgrounds. Cards float above the background.
- **Information hierarchy through opacity**: White text at 100% / 70% / 45% / 30%.
- **RTL-native**: Hebrew text uses `writingDirection: 'rtl'`, `textAlign: 'right'`.
- **Breathing room**: Generous spacing. Let elements breathe. Avoid cramming.

## Color System

### Backgrounds (green-black, NOT gray-black)

- **Screen**: `colors.background.primary` (`#0A0E0A`) — deep dark with green-black undertone.
- **Secondary surface**: `colors.background.secondary` (`#0F1A0F`).
- **Tertiary**: `colors.background.tertiary` (`#142014`).
- **Elevated**: `colors.background.elevated` (`#1A2B1A`).
- **Card (glass)**: `colors.background.card` (`rgba(255,255,255,0.05)`).
- **Card (solid)**: `colors.background.cardSolid` (`#141F14`).
- **Input fields**: `colors.background.input` (`rgba(255,255,255,0.06)`).
- **Header**: `colors.background.header` (`rgba(15,26,15,0.85)`) + blur 30.
- **Tab bar**: `colors.background.tabBar` (`rgba(10,14,10,0.95)`) + blur 30.
- **Bottom sheet**: `colors.background.sheet` (`#121E12`).
- **Overlay**: `colors.background.overlay` (`rgba(0,0,0,0.60)`).

### Text (opacity hierarchy)

- **Primary**: `colors.text.primary` (`#FFFFFF`) — headings, body.
- **Secondary**: `colors.text.secondary` (`rgba(255,255,255,0.70)`) — subtitles, metadata.
- **Tertiary**: `colors.text.tertiary` (`rgba(255,255,255,0.45)`) — timestamps, inactive.
- **Muted**: `colors.text.muted` (`rgba(255,255,255,0.30)`) — placeholders, disabled.
- **Inverse**: `colors.text.inverse` (`#0A0E0A`) — text on green buttons.
- **Accent**: `colors.text.accent` (`#00C805`).

### Accent System

- `colors.primary.main` (`#00C805`) — primary CTA, active states, gains.
- `colors.primary.light` (`#33D43B`) — hover/highlight.
- `colors.primary.dark` (`#00A004`) — pressed states.
- `colors.primary.dim` (`rgba(0,200,5,0.12)`) — muted backgrounds.
- `colors.primary.subtle` (`rgba(0,200,5,0.06)`) — barely visible accents.

### Borders

- **Default**: `colors.border.default` (`rgba(255,255,255,0.08)`) — barely visible.
- **Subtle**: `colors.border.subtle` (`rgba(255,255,255,0.04)`).
- **Strong**: `colors.border.strong` (`rgba(255,255,255,0.15)`).
- **Accent**: `colors.border.accent` (`rgba(0,200,5,0.30)`).
- **Divider**: `colors.border.divider` (`rgba(255,255,255,0.06)`).

## Typography Hierarchy

Use tokens from `typography` — never hardcode font sizes or weights.

| Role | Token | Size | Weight |
|------|-------|------|--------|
| Display | `typography.display` | 40px | 900 (Black) |
| Hero title | `typography.heroTitle` | 34px | 800 (ExtraBold) |
| Title | `typography.title` | 28px | 700 (Bold) |
| Title 2 | `typography.title2` | 22px | 700 |
| Subtitle | `typography.subtitle` | 18px | 600 |
| Body | `typography.body` | 16px | 400 |
| Callout | `typography.callout` | 15px | 400 |
| Subhead | `typography.subhead` | 14px | 500 |
| Footnote | `typography.footnote` | 13px | 400 |
| Caption | `typography.caption` | 12px | 500 |
| Caption 2 | `typography.caption2` | 11px | 600 |
| Button | `typography.button` | 17px | 700 |
| Tab bar | `typography.tabBarLabel` | 10px | 500 |

Weight contrast matters: headers 700-900, body 400, captions 500-600.

## Spacing Scale

Use `spacing` tokens:
- `spacing['2xs']` (2px), `spacing.xs` (4px), `spacing.sm` (8px), `spacing.md` (12px)
- `spacing.base` (16px), `spacing.lg` (20px), `spacing.xl` (24px)
- `spacing['2xl']` (32px), `spacing['3xl']` (40px), `spacing['4xl']` (48px), `spacing['5xl']` (64px)

## Border Radius

- `borderRadius.xs` (4px) — small badges
- `borderRadius.sm` (8px) — small buttons
- `borderRadius.md` (12px) — buttons, inputs
- `borderRadius.lg` (16px) — cards (standard)
- `borderRadius.xl` (20px) — large cards
- `borderRadius['2xl']` (24px) — modals
- `borderRadius.full` (9999) — pills, avatars

## Glass System

- **Card**: bg `rgba(255,255,255,0.05)`, blur 20, border `rgba(255,255,255,0.08)`.
- **Elevated card**: bg `rgba(255,255,255,0.08)`, blur 24, border `rgba(255,255,255,0.10)`.
- **Header**: bg `rgba(15,26,15,0.85)`, blur 30.
- **Tab bar**: bg `rgba(10,14,10,0.95)`, blur 30.
- **Bottom sheet**: blur 40.

Use `colors.glass.*` tokens for glass surfaces.

## Cards & Surfaces

- Default card: `borderRadius.lg` (16px), glass bg, border `colors.border.default`.
- Solid card: `colors.background.cardSolid`, `borderRadius.lg`.
- Elevated card: `colors.glass.cardElevated.bg`, blur 24, `colors.glass.cardElevated.border`.
- Accent card: Green border `colors.border.accent`, green glow shadow.
- Prefer borderless cards with background contrast over explicit borders.

## Tabs / Segmented Controls (Content Tabs)

- **Active tab pill**: `colors.background.tabActive` (`#00C805`) background, `colors.text.inverse` (`#0A0E0A`) text, weight 600.
- **Inactive tab**: transparent, `colors.text.secondary` (`rgba(255,255,255,0.55)`) text.
- Pill shape: `borderRadius.full`.
- Container: horizontal row with `spacing.sm` gap.

```tsx
const activeTab = {
  backgroundColor: tokens.colors.background.tabActive,
  paddingHorizontal: tokens.spacing.base,
  paddingVertical: tokens.spacing.sm,
  borderRadius: tokens.borderRadius.full,
};
```

## Bottom Tab Bar

- Background: `#0A0E0A` (or glass with blur).
- Border top: `colors.border.divider`, hairline width.
- Active icon: `#00C805` with green pill highlight (`rgba(0,200,5,0.15)`).
- Inactive icon: `rgba(255,255,255,0.40)`.
- Label: 10px. Active = `#00C805`, inactive = `rgba(255,255,255,0.40)`.
- **Keep the green pill** — this is a signature UI element.

## Buttons

Use `UIButton` component — never create custom pressables.

- **Primary**: Green bg (`#00C805`), dark text (`#0A0E0A`), height 52px, `borderRadius.md` (12), green glow shadow.
- **Secondary**: Glass bg, subtle border, white text, height 52px.
- **Ghost**: No bg, green text.
- **Outline**: Transparent, green border.
- **Small**: Height 40px, `borderRadius.sm` (8).
- Press: opacity 0.92, scale 0.985.

## Inputs

Use `UIInput` component.

- Background: `colors.background.input` (`rgba(255,255,255,0.06)`).
- Border: `colors.border.default`, focus = `colors.border.accent`.
- Height: 48px, `borderRadius.md` (12).
- Text: `colors.text.primary`, placeholder: `colors.text.muted`.

## Layout

- Screen padding: `layout.screenPadding` (20px).
- Section gap: `layout.sectionGap` (24px).
- Card padding: `layout.cardPadding` (16px).
- List item height: `layout.listItemHeight` (60px).
- Header height: `layout.headerHeight` (56px).
- Tab bar height: `layout.tabBarHeight` (56px) + safe area.

## Animations

- Use `react-native-reanimated`.
- Spring: `animation.springPresets.snappy` for UI, `.gentle` for sheets.
- All interactions under 250ms. Sheets up to 400ms.
- Staggered list items: fade-in + translateY, 30ms delay per item.

## Screen Background

Use `ScreenGradientBackground` from `components/VideoBackground.tsx`:
- Gradient: `['#0A0E0A', '#0F1A0F', '#0A0E0A']` vertical.
- Never duplicate gradient code in screens.

## Anti-Patterns — NEVER Do These

- NEVER hardcode colors — use `useDesignTokens()`.
- NEVER create local `COLORS` constants.
- NEVER use `DesignTokens` static import in components — use `useDesignTokens()` hook.
- NEVER duplicate gradient backgrounds — use `ScreenGradientBackground`.
- NEVER use gray-black backgrounds — always green-black undertone.
- NEVER use pure black `#000000` — use `colors.background.primary`.
- NEVER remove the green pill from bottom tabs.
- NEVER use more than 2 accent colors per screen.
- NEVER leave status bar unstyled — `light-content` on dark.
- NEVER skip loading/empty states.
